# TrendForge core

- Stack: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind 4 + Vercel serverless `api/x-search.js`
- Production: `https://trendforge-opal.vercel.app`
- Secrets: `X_BEARER_TOKEN` only in Vercel / local env — never in client code or git
- Prefer pure helpers in `src/lib/`; keep `App.tsx` as orchestration
- After meaningful UI/API changes: `npm run lint && npm run test && npm run build`
